{"3951270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Suck It Up", "steam_appid": 3951270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Suck It Up: A deadly dust infestation has been festering for decades… until you arrived.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast through waves of dirty creatures in this <strong>fast-paced roguelite FPS</strong>. Vacuum up the chaos to reload and gain upgrades—the more you vacuum, the stronger you become! Dodge hazards, crush your foes, and Suck. It. Up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Vacuum dust to reload, blast enemies, pick augments, and repeat until chaos buries you.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VACUUM UP DUST!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951270/extras/3021641fa84cf2b7fbf9bd8be856a370.poster.avif?t=1772529016\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951270/extras/3021641fa84cf2b7fbf9bd8be856a370.webm?t=1772529016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951270/extras/3021641fa84cf2b7fbf9bd8be856a370.mp4?t=1772529016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vacuum</strong> to <strong>reload</strong> your weapons!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHOOT DUSTY CREATURES!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951270/extras/75a0a60d0dd75ef9b30a7396bd94e3bc.poster.avif?t=1772529016\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951270/extras/75a0a60d0dd75ef9b30a7396bd94e3bc.webm?t=1772529016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><s